  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="88bf4dcc-3295-556a-9082-6a4306280ffe" activityNameId="acae4e52-f55d-523d-bb07-0b0fb4bcce2c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Window frame, wood, w/o surface treatment, wall opening, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Window frame, wood, w/o surface treatment, wall opening, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The wall opening is 1.8 m2 (assumption width of frame 0.12m, 2/3 of frame are behind the wall opening). 1m2 (wall opening) of wooden window frame weighs 19.8kg. The bill of materials is based on data from 3 window producers.;
UUID: dee05f1c-feeb-3b2e-8133-9f12a9a01494
Included are the materials used in a wooden window frame (without surface treatment). Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_dee05f1c-feeb-3b2e-8133-9f12a9a01494.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
